# Persist returns Kitchen Finks "with a -1/-1 counter on it" (CR 702.79a, 122.6): a -1/-1 counter is no +1/+1 counter, so
# neither Hardened Scales nor Corpsejack Menace, both about +1/+1 counters alone (CR 614.1a), changes it. Bolted, Finks comes
# back a 2/1 with that one -1/-1 counter and no +1/+1 counter, and Bot1 gains 2 life each time it enters.

